# Keep the build context small and never bake secrets or host-built artifacts
# into the image. Without this, `COPY client/ ./` would overwrite the deps
# stage's `npm ci` node_modules with the host's copy and embed .env.local.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.env*
**/.clerk
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.agents
.kiro
.vscode
.playwright-cli
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
README.md
CLAUDE.md
